@quickgo.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010

### B1-01 Registrar empresa (Transportista) + admin
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/empresas/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreComercial": "Transportes Honduras",
  "razonSocial": "Transportes Honduras S.A.",
  "rtn": "08019999123456",
  "tipo": "Transportista",
  "primerNombre": "Ana",
  "primerApellido": "López",
  "email": "ana@transportes.hn",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### B1-01 Login
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@transportes.hn", "password": "Secreta123" }

### B1-03 Roles (reemplaza TOKEN por el del login)
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/catalogos/roles
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### B1-04 Registrar conductor externo
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "primerNombre": "Luis",
  "primerApellido": "Mejía",
  "tipoConductor": "Externo",
  "licencia": "LIC-0001",
  "venceLicencia": "2027-03-01"
}

### B1-05 Licencias por vencer en 60 días
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores/licencias-por-vencer?dias=60
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Modo Dev (solo Development): sin login, con headers
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores
X-Empresa-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
X-Rol: Despachador
